<header class="sw-header">
  <div class="sw-header__in">
    {%- comment -%}
      Sous 800 px, la navigation est masquée. Elle l'était sans rien pour la
      remplacer : un visiteur sur téléphone n'avait aucun accès au guide des
      tailles ni à l'aide. Ce bouton n'existe qu'en dessous de ce seuil.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <button
      type="button"
      class="sw-burger"
      data-sw-menu-open
      aria-label="Ouvrir le menu"
      aria-expanded="false"
      aria-controls="SwMenu">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true">
        <path d="M3 6h18M3 12h18M3 18h18"/>
      </svg>
    </button>

    <a class="sw-header__logo" href="{{ routes.root_url }}">
      {%- if section.settings.logo != blank -%}
        <img src="{{ section.settings.logo | image_url: width: 400 }}" alt="{{ shop.name | escape }}" height="26">
      {%- else -%}
        {{ shop.name }}
      {%- endif -%}
    </a>

    <nav class="sw-header__nav">
      {%- for link in section.settings.menu.links -%}
        <a href="{{ link.url }}">{{ link.title }}</a>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </nav>

    <a class="sw-header__cart" href="{{ routes.cart_url }}">
      Panier <span class="sw-header__count" data-sw-cart-count>{{ cart.item_count }}</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</header>

{%- comment -%}
  Les liens portent une classe : sans elle, la règle qui souligne les liens
  sans classe les attraperait au passage.
{%- endcomment -%}
<div class="sw sw-menu" id="SwMenu" data-sw-menu hidden>
  <button type="button" class="sw-menu__veil" data-sw-menu-close tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"></button>
  <div class="sw-menu__panel" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="Menu" tabindex="-1" data-sw-menu-panel>
    <button type="button" class="sw-menu__close" data-sw-menu-close aria-label="Fermer le menu">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true">
        <path d="M5 5l14 14M19 5L5 19"/>
      </svg>
    </button>
    {%- for link in section.settings.menu.links -%}
      <a class="sw-menu__link" href="{{ link.url }}">{{ link.title }}</a>
    {%- endfor -%}
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "En-tête",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "logo", "label": "Logo" },
    { "type": "link_list", "id": "menu", "label": "Menu", "default": "main-menu" }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
